---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Load a template from a file made by `template save --output`

Usage: bento template load [OPTIONS] <FILE>

Arguments:
  <FILE>
          File made by `bento template save --output`

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

      --no-input
          Never prompt; commands that need an answer fail with the command to run instead

  -h, --help
          Print help
